t版本\u003C\u002Fstrong>。\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"border-width:1px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);font-size:1rem\">\u003Ccode>下载链接: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet\u002Freleases\u002Fdownload\u002Fv1.0.0\u002FEarTrumpet.ScreenAudioRouterEdition.zip\">version 1.0.0\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fcode>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#screen-audio-router-in-eartrumpet\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>总览\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#overview\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">这是\u003Cstrong> Windows 音频音量控制器 EarTrumpet（音量喇叭）的一款增强修改版\u003C\u002Fstrong>。\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">其核心新增功能为\u003Cstrong>显示器音频路由（Screen Audio Router）\u003C\u002Fstrong>，可实现\u003Cstrong>窗口跨屏移动时的音频设备自动切换\u003C\u002Fstrong>。\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>核心功能\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#core-features\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. \u003Cstrong>保留 EarTrumpet 原版全部功能\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#1-original-eartrumpet-features-retained\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh6>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. \u003Cstrong>新增功能：显示器音频路由\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#2-new-added-feature-screen-audio-router\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh6>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u003Cem>当窗口在多屏间移动时，\u003Cstrong>自动切换至该显示器预设的对应音频设备\u003C\u002Fstrong>。\u003C\u002Fem>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>使用方法\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#usage\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在\u003Cstrong>设置面板\u003C\u002Fstrong>的\u003Cstrong>显示器音频路由设置项\u003C\u002Fstrong>中，为每台显示器配置对应的音频输出设备。\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cfigure class=\"wp-block-image\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002FResources\u002FScreenAudioRouter.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" src=\"\u002Fuploads\u002Fposts\u002F762\u002F771-1767520763-ScreenAudioRouter.png\" alt=\"ScreenAudioRouter\" class=\"wp-image-771\" \u002F>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Ffigure>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>已知问题\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#known-issues\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cblockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n\u003Cul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\u003Cli>切换音频时，\u003Cstrong>不会单独切换指定的音频流\u003C\u002Fstrong>，而是切换\u003Cstrong>同一程序名对应的所有进程\u003C\u002Fstrong>。具体来说：若你打开了两个谷歌浏览器窗口（窗口 A 和窗口 B），仅将窗口 B 拖至显示器 2，窗口 A 的音频也会随之切换到显示器 2 的音频设备。\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>若\u003Cstrong>直接在显示器 2 上打开窗口\u003C\u002Fstrong>，音频\u003Cstrong>不会自动切换\u003C\u002Fstrong>到显示器 2 对应的音频设备。\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\u003C\u002Fblockquote>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>许可证\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#license\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">项目\u003Cstrong>继承原版 EarTrumpet 项目的 MIT 许可证\u003C\u002Fstrong>。详细信息请参阅&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002FLICENSE\">LICENSE\u003C\u002Fa>&nbsp;文件。\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n\n\n\u003Chr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\u002F>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>参考资料\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet#reference\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\u003Cli>原版 EarTrumpet 说明文档：:&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FScreenAudioRouter-inEarTrumpet\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002FEarTrumpet_README.md\">EarTrumpet README.md\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n","\u003Cp>一个内置屏幕路由器功能（ScreenAudioRouter）的EarTrumpet版本。 下载链接: vers [&hellip;]\u003C\u002Fp>","\u002Fuploads\u002Fposts\u002F762\u002F771-1767520763-ScreenAudioRouter.png",[110,112],{"id":18,"title":20,"slug":19,"path":111,"isHome":22},"\u002Fhome",{"id":41,"title":61,"slug":60,"path":113,"isHome":30},"\u002Fcategory\u002Fproject",[],"published","html",{"tocSide":118,"tocProgress":22,"heroImage":13,"heroSize":37,"miniNav":22,"sectionNumbers":22,"linkUrl":13,"linkDelay":34},"right",{"post":100,"views":120},16,{"comments":122},[],1791216025661]